# NOTE: unlike a typical analysis repo, generated outputs are intentionally
# version-controlled here so the results are browsable without a local run:
#   - data/processed/          (cleaned data, codebook, ECI scores, summary)
#   - code/outputs/figures/    (PNG + PDF)
#   - code/outputs/tables/     (CSV + LaTeX)
# Regenerate them any time with:  cd code && uv sync && uv run python run_all.py
